5. WHAT THIS LICENCE LEAVES FREE

This licence governs the expression of the Work. It leaves free the general
ideas, methods, and facts the Work discusses, which copyright law places outside
its reach. A person may read the documentation, understand the approach it
describes, and build their own system independently. This licence attaches when
that person copies, adapts, or reproduces the copyright holder's expression:
the role briefs, the contract definitions, the rule sets, the code, and the
structure of the whole.


